  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/PandaLib/raw/main/assets/banner.png?raw=true\" alt=\"banner.png\"></p>\n<blockquote>\n  <p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/wjPt4vEfXb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1021703635178115122?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&label=Discord&labelColor=black&color=lightblue\" alt=\"Discord\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpandalib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/mEEGbEIu?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&label=Modrinth&labelColor=black&color=green\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pandalib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/975460?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&label=Curseforge&labelColor=black&color=red\" alt=\"Curseforge\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/PandaDap2006/PandaLib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/downloads/PandaDap2006/PandaLib/total?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&label=Github&labelColor=black&color=white\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a></p>\n  <p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Fabric%20API-REQUIRED%20for%20Fabric-1?style=for-the-badge&labelColor=black&color=gold\" alt=\"Fabric API\"></a></p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>關於：</h2>\n<p>PandaLib 是一款用於 Minecraft 的函式庫模組，提供多種 API 與工具以簡化模組開發。</p>\n<p>該函式庫使用 Kotlin 編寫，部分 API 可能無法獲得 Java 的完整支援。</p>\n<h3>目前功能：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>多載入器框架（開發中）</li>\n<li>設定檔 API<ul>\n<li>同步 API</li>\n<li>內建格式：JSON</li></ul></li>\n<li>事件／監聽器 API</li>\n<li>延遲註冊 API</li>\n<li>網路通訊 API<ul>\n<li>遊戲進行階段支援</li>\n<li>配置階段支援</li></ul></li>\n<li>內嵌函式庫<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/universal-serializer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">通用序列化器</a></li>\n<li>內嵌 Kotlin 函式庫</li>\n<li>Kotlin 標準函式庫</li>\n<li>反射 (Reflect)</li>\n<li>協程 (Coroutines)</li>\n<li>序列化 (Serialization)</li>\n<li>I/O</li>\n<li>日期時間 (DateTime)</li></ul></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>未來功能：</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>規劃中</th>\n<th>開發中</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>設定檔序列化器（TOML、YAML、XML、Properties）</td>\n<td>多載入器框架</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>設定選單 API</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>維基／文件</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3>支援的版本與載入器：</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模組載入器</th>\n<th>版本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Fabric</td>\n<td>1.20 – 1.21.10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NeoForge</td>\n<td>1.20.5 – 1.21.10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Forge</td>\n<td>已停止支援</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>開發目標為 1.21.10</p>\n<hr>\n<h3>開發資訊：</h3>\n<h4>尋找特定版本的程式碼庫</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>1.21</strong><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/PandaLib/tree/versions/1.21.10\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.21.10</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/PandaLib/tree/versions/1.21.9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.21.9</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/PandaLib/tree/versions/1.21.8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.21.8</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/PandaLib/tree/versions/1.21.7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.21.7</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/PandaLib/tree/versions/1.21.6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.21.6</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/PandaLib/tree/versions/1.21.5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.21.5</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/PandaLib/tree/versions/1.21.4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.21.4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/PandaLib/tree/versions/1.21.3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.21.3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/PandaLib/tree/versions/1.21.2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.21.2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/PandaLib/tree/versions/1.21.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.21.1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/PandaLib/tree/versions/1.21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.21.0</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><strong>1.20</strong><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/PandaLib/tree/versions/1.20.6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.20.6</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/PandaLib/tree/versions/1.20.5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.20.5</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/PandaLib/tree/versions/1.20.4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.20.4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/PandaLib/tree/versions/1.20.3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.20.3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/PandaLib/tree/versions/1.20.2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.20.2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/PandaLib/tree/versions/1.20.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.20.1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/PandaLib/tree/versions/1.20\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.20.0</a></li></ul></li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Kotlin DSL</h4>\n<pre><code>repositories {\n    mavenCentral()\n    maven(\"<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252frepo.pandasystems.dev%252frepository%252fmaven-public%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://repo.pandasystems.dev/repository/maven-public/</a>\")\n}\n\ndependencies {\n    modApi(\"dev.pandasystems:pandalib-common-&lt;game version&gt;:&lt;version&gt;\") // 通用\n    api(\"dev.pandasystems:pandalib-neoforge-&lt;game version&gt;:&lt;version&gt;\")  // NeoForge\n    modApi(\"dev.pandasystems:pandalib-fabric-&lt;game version&gt;:&lt;version&gt;\") // Fabric\n\n    // 僅在 NeoForge 環境中使用內嵌 Kotlin 函式庫時需要。\n    additionalRuntimeClasspath(kotlin(\"stdlib\"))\n    additionalRuntimeClasspath(kotlin(\"stdlib-jdk8\"))\n    additionalRuntimeClasspath(kotlin(\"stdlib-jdk7\"))\n    additionalRuntimeClasspath(kotlin(\"reflect\", version = \"2.2.0\"))\n    additionalRuntimeClasspath(\"org.jetbrains.kotlinx:kotlinx-coroutines-core:1.10.2\")\n    additionalRuntimeClasspath(\"org.jetbrains.kotlinx:kotlinx-coroutines-jdk8:1.10.2\")\n    additionalRuntimeClasspath(\"org.jetbrains.kotlinx:kotlinx-serialization-core:1.8.1\")\n    additionalRuntimeClasspath(\"org.jetbrains.kotlinx:kotlinx-serialization-json:1.8.1\")\n    additionalRuntimeClasspath(\"org.jetbrains.kotlinx:kotlinx-serialization-cbor:1.8.1\")\n    additionalRuntimeClasspath(\"org.jetbrains.kotlinx:kotlinx-datetime:0.6.2\")\n    additionalRuntimeClasspath(\"org.jetbrains.kotlinx:kotlinx-io-core:0.7.0\")\n    additionalRuntimeClasspath(\"org.jetbrains.kotlinx:kotlinx-io-bytestring:0.7.0\")\n}</code></pre>\n<hr>\n<h2>贊助資訊：</h2>\n<blockquote>\n  <h3>感謝 <strong>Kinetic Hosting</strong> 對本專案的支援</h3>\n  <p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.kinetichosting.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d476\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/ThePandaOliver/blob/main/assets_for_readme/Support/kinetic_hosting_banner.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Partner Banner\"></a></p>\n  <p>透過我的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.kinetichosting.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d476\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">推薦連結</a>購買的伺服器，將有助於支持我與我的工作。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>授權條款</h2>\n<p>本專案採用 GNU LGPLv3 授權條款。</p>",
